Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: erhai-speakers
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, e2fsprogs
Description: Thermal speaker protection for the OnePlus Pad 3
 Follows the current each speaker amplifier reports, models the voice
 coil temperature of every speaker from it and the factory calibration,
 and turns a speaker down before its coil overheats.
